[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation BaseConversation.WaterRitual.TinkeringRecipeChoice.Text | Would you teach me to craft =recipe=? => 你愿意教我制作 =recipe= 吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation BaseConversation.WaterRitual.HermitOathChoice.Text | I promise not to bother you again, =hermit=. => 我保证不再打扰你，=hermit=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation BaseConversation.WaterRitual.BuyValuedItemChoice.Text | Would you gift me your =object.nameSingle=? => 你愿意把你的 =object.nameSingle= 赠予我吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation BaseConversation.WaterRitual.BuyFactionItemChoice.Text | Would you gift me your =object.nameSingle=? => 你愿意把你的 =object.nameSingle= 赠予我吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation BaseConversation.WaterRitual.RandomMentalMutationChoice.WaterRitualRandomMutation | =subject.T= =verb:grab= your hand and you close your eyes. You find =player.reflexive= in a darkling thicket. =subject.T= =verb:tug= you over roots of braided nether, until finally you stumble into a glade. Others are here. You take their hands as =subject.t= took yours.\n\nAfter a moment or an eon, you awaken knowing =mutation.name=. => =subject.T= =verb:grab=住你的手，你闭上双眼。你发现=player.reflexive=身处幽暗灌丛。=subject.T= =verb:tug=着你越过编结幽冥的根，直到你终于跌进一片林间空地。这里还有其他人。你握住他们的手，如同 =subject.t= 握住你的手。\n\n一瞬或一个纪元之后，你醒来时已经知晓 =mutation.name=。
