[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation BaseConversation.WaterRitual.EndChoice.Text | Live and drink, =subject.waterRitualLiquid=-=pronouns.siblingTerm=. => 生而饮水，=subject.waterRitualLiquid=-=pronouns.siblingTerm=。
