[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation BaseConversation.TellName.StartChoice.Text | Thank you, =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=. => 谢谢你，=pronouns.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation BaseConversation.TellName.StartChoice.Text2 | My thanks, =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=. => 多谢，=pronouns.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation BaseConversation.TellName.StartChoice.Text3 | Pleased to meet you, =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=. => 很高兴认识你，=pronouns.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation JoppaFarmerConvert.SpeakNoMore2.Text | =name=! Live and drink, pilgrim. => =name=！生而饮水，朝圣者。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation JoppaFarmerConvert.FinishedPilgrimageQuest.Text | =name=! Live and drink, pilgrim. => =name=！生而饮水，朝圣者。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation JoppaFarmerConvert.Stilted.Text | Ah!\n\nTell me, =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=, was it the picture of wonder as I see it in my mind's eye? Were you beauty-struck by its truths? => 啊！\n\n告诉我，=pronouns.formalAddressTerm=，它是否如我心眼中所见那般奇妙？你是否被它真理中的美击中了？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation JoppaFarmerConvert.Well.Text | Moon and Sun! The Argent Fathers bless us, our paths are chromed and glistering.\n\nYou have my thanks, =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=. Bel shield you. => 月与日！白银诸父祝福我们，我们的道路覆铬而闪耀。\n\n你有我的谢意，=pronouns.formalAddressTerm=。愿贝尔庇护你。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation JoppaFarmerConvert.Flipped.Text | Oh, how your words rasp my soul, =player.formalAddressTerm=. You abrade me.\n\nLet us speak no more. => 噢，你的话何等刮擦我的灵魂，=player.formalAddressTerm=。你磨损了我。\n\n我们不要再说了。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation JoppaFarmerConvert.ShakyNah.Text | Wh-\n\nMy heart's sheen wanes to hear this of you. You abrade me, =player.formalAddressTerm=, I am scuffed.\n\nWhat of my trinket, then? Did you cast it into the... "hole in the ground?" => 什——\n\n听你这么说，我心中的光泽黯淡了。你磨损了我，=player.formalAddressTerm=，我被刮花了。\n\n那我的小饰物呢？你把它投入了那个……“地上的洞”吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation JoppaFarmerConvert.HasPilgrimageQuest.Text | Wanderer and =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=! Have you journeyed yet to the Stilt, and seen the Sacred Well? => 游人兼 =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=！你可曾前往高跷，见到圣井？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation JoppaFarmerConvert.Agree.Text | Moon and sun, =pronouns.formalAddressTerm=! You have my deep and many-sided thanks. Here, take the trinket now. And if you're to ever return, let us visit again.\n\nLive and drink! => 月与日，=pronouns.formalAddressTerm=！请收下我深切而多面的感谢。来，现在拿上这件小饰物。若你日后归来，让我们再相见。\n\n生而饮水！
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Start.Text.Text | -mm. Mmm? =player.FormalAddressTerm=. => ——嗯。嗯？=player.FormalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Start.Text.Text2 | {{emote|*Elder Irudad smiles.*}} => {{emote|*长老伊鲁达德微笑。*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Start.Text.Text3 | {{emote|*Elder Irudad smiles.*}}\n\nCome in- come sit 'neath the cool shade, 'cross a pillow there. => {{emote|*长老伊鲁达德微笑。*}}\n\n进来——来坐在清凉阴影下，那边的垫子上。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Start.Text.Text4 | {{emote|*Elder Irudad smiles.*}}\n\nLive and drink, =name=. Come, sit with me. => {{emote|*长老伊鲁达德微笑。*}}\n\n生而饮水，=name=。来，陪我坐坐。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Welcome.Text | -mm. Mmm? =player.FormalAddressTerm=?\n\n{{emote|*Elder Irudad smiles.*}}\n\nLive and drink. Come in- come sit 'neath the cool shade, 'cross a pillow there. And welcome to Joppa.\n\nYou may drink of our freshwater, too, and quench your thirst. => ——嗯。嗯？=player.FormalAddressTerm=？\n\n{{emote|*长老伊鲁达德微笑。*}}\n\n生而饮水。进来——来坐在清凉阴影下，那边的垫子上。欢迎来到约帕。\n\n你也可以饮用我们的淡水，解解渴。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Joppa.Text | -this? The oasis-hamlet. 'Neath the shelf of the world. A million breaths of salt the wind heaves over the Great Salt Desert Moghra'yi. And to the east, the rotting jungles of Qud.\n\nHere in the crack between the two, watervine can grow, and we grow it. mmm, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => ——这里？绿洲小村。在世界架层之下。风把百万口盐息吹过莫格拉伊大盐漠。而东方，是库德腐烂的丛林。\n\n就在两者之间的裂隙里，水藤能够生长，而我们种植它。嗯，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Qud.Text | -mm, there? Land slopes up and is toothed in chrome steeples, ageless things. Looming over the old-earth tunnels, pillowed in rotting jungle and fungus groves. And broken against the mounts of the north, they are, in the shadow of the Spindle...\n\nThere are people, friends, communities. And friends-to-noone, too. History is thick as the high salt sun, =player.formalAddressTerm=, and where the past is ground up like matz meal, a mix of life sets in.\n\n-mm, adventurous ones set off for their own splinter of artifact. To both Fates, life and death... => ——嗯，那里？土地向上倾斜，长着铬钢尖塔般的齿，那些无龄之物。它们耸立在旧土隧道之上，枕在腐烂丛林与真菌林中。又在北方山脉前碎裂，处在纺锤的阴影里……\n\n那里有人，有朋友，有社群。也有谁都不友善的存在。历史像高悬的盐日一样厚重，=player.formalAddressTerm=，而在过去被碾成无酵饼粉的地方，各种生命混杂扎根。\n\n——嗯，爱冒险的人会出发，去寻找属于自己的神器碎片。敬两种命运，生命与死亡……
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Work.Text | -mm, work? The farmers are plagued by cave vermin. You might speak to Mehmet o' there, by the southern watervine patch.\n\nAnd Argyve, too, =player.formalAddressTerm=. The tinker. Always looking for trinkets to wire between, heh. Go through his hut of sheet metal, to the southwest. => ——嗯，活干？农民正受洞穴害兽困扰。你可以去和那边的穆罕默德谈谈，就在南边水藤田旁。\n\n还有阿吉夫，=player.formalAddressTerm=。那个修补匠。总在找小玩意接线，呵。往西南去，穿过他的铁皮小屋。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.WorkAfter.Text | -mm, work? Try Argyve, =player.formalAddressTerm=. The tinker. Always looking for trinkets to wire between, heh. Go through his hut of sheet metal, to the southwest. => ——嗯，活干？去找阿吉夫试试，=player.formalAddressTerm=。那个修补匠。总在找小玩意接线，呵。往西南去，穿过他的铁皮小屋。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.FinishedRedrock.Text | -this? Oh? Oh...\n\n{{emote|*Elder Irudad pauses for several minutes.*}}\n\nWarted leg? mm. Foul smell of sour gum? mmm. Moon and sun....\n\nA girshling? This is a girshling. => ——这个？噢？噢……\n\n{{emote|*长老伊鲁达德停顿了好几分钟。*}}\n\n长疣的腿？嗯。酸胶的恶臭？嗯。月与日……\n\n一只吉尔什幼体？这是吉尔什幼体。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Girshling.Text | Creature of plague, =player.formalAddressTerm=. mmm. This one...\n\n{{emote|*Elder Irudad pauses.*}}\n\nThis one covered in slick and muscled out the bilge hose of sleeping Agolgot, in the cave under the Cloaca...\n\n-mm, but here? Girshling this far west? There must be hundreds for one to reach... mm, does the Gyre widen again?? => 瘟疫之物，=player.formalAddressTerm=。嗯。这个……\n\n{{emote|*长老伊鲁达德停顿。*}}\n\n这东西浑身滑腻，从泄殖腔下方洞穴里沉睡阿戈尔戈特的舱底排水管中强行挤出……\n\n——嗯，可是在这里？吉尔什幼体到了这么西边？必定有成百上千只，才会有一只抵达……嗯，轮回又在扩张了吗？？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Gyre.Text | {{emote|*Elder Irudad pauses.*}}\n\n-mm, plagues. Of our great grandsires many-times-over. Salt, darkness, svardym-frog... Girshling. => {{emote|*长老伊鲁达德停顿。*}}\n\n——嗯，瘟疫。我们许多代以前祖祖辈辈的瘟疫。盐，黑暗，斯瓦尔丁蛙……吉尔什幼体。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Agolgot2.Text | {{emote|*Elder Irudad pauses.*}}\n\n-mm, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Do not like to sour the air with a harsh word! But this tiding bites my liver like acid. mm, must ask Nima for an elixir of yuckwheat... => {{emote|*长老伊鲁达德停顿。*}}\n\n——嗯，=player.formalAddressTerm=。我不喜欢用刺耳话语酸败空气！但这消息像酸一样咬我的肝。嗯，必须去找妮玛要一剂恶心麦药水……
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Nephilim.Text | {{emote|*Elder Irudad pauses.*}}\n\n-mm, nephilim. Seventh plague. Girsh titans born on the Moon Stair, and quickened to life to eat our young. Sultan Resheph drove them back a chiliad ago, away to slumber. mm, do they rouse? => {{emote|*长老伊鲁达德停顿。*}}\n\n——嗯，拿非利。第七瘟疫。诞生于月阶的吉尔什巨人，被激活成生命来吞食我们的幼子。一千年前，苏丹瑞谢夫把他们赶回去沉睡。嗯，他们要醒来了吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.Apology.Text | -mm? No, =player.formalAddressTerm=! Your finding is rich in value to us. We are poor farmers, and sharpen our vinereapers is all we can do. But others? Perhaps more.\n\nTake these prickly-boons as thanks. mm, I will not soon forget this, =name=. Leave me now to muse, kindly... => ——嗯？不，=player.formalAddressTerm=！你的发现对我们极有价值。我们只是贫苦农民，能做的只有磨快藤镰。但其他人呢？或许能做更多。\n\n收下这些刺恩果作为谢礼。嗯，我不会很快忘记这事，=name=。现在请让我独自沉思吧……
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.GyreReminder.Text | -mm, yes? Plagues, a chiliad old. Seven such: girshlings, darkness. mm, svardym-frog...\n\nAh, nephilim, too, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Girsh titans who eat the young of kith and kin. Sultan Resheph drove them under the earth, but do they stir?? => ——嗯，是吗？瘟疫，一千年前的瘟疫。共有七种：吉尔什幼体，黑暗。嗯，斯瓦尔丁蛙……\n\n啊，还有拿非利，=player.formalAddressTerm=。吞食亲族幼子的吉尔什巨人。苏丹瑞谢夫把他们驱入地下，但他们在躁动吗？？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.SlynthRequestAccept.Text | mm, I am for you, =name=. Any friend of yours is too a friend of Joppa, and if those friends desire shelter I wouldn't dare turn them away. I only hope these lilypad-folk have the patience for a farmer's life. -mm, not as exciting here as it was in the Palladium Reef. => 嗯，我支持你，=name=。你的任何朋友也都是约帕的朋友；若这些朋友想要庇护，我不敢拒绝他们。我只希望这些睡莲叶之民有耐心过农夫的生活。——嗯，这里可不像钯礁那么刺激。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.SlynthRequestReject.Text | -mm, blessings upon your generous heart, =name=. I mean no slight to these slynth, but it is too great a favor you ask of the people of Joppa. => ——嗯，愿祝福落在你慷慨的心上，=name=。我无意轻慢这些斯林思，但你向约帕人民请求的恩惠太大了。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.SlynthAbout.Text | Have you spoken to the slynth, =name=? I am curious to hear what destination they choose. => 你和斯林思谈过了吗，=name=？我很好奇他们会选择什么目的地。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Irudad.SlynthSettled.Text | -mm, ah, =name=. Come see how the slynth have become a part of Joppa!\n\nSome cared not for the slow pace of our lives and struck out on their own, and with their thews and wits I have no doubt they will live to find purpose. mm, others are welcome to grow and flourish here in our marshes. => ——嗯，啊，=name=。来看看斯林思如何成为约帕的一部分！\n\n有些人不喜欢我们生活的缓慢步调，便独自出发；凭他们的筋力和智慧，我毫不怀疑他们会活着找到目标。嗯，其他人则欢迎在我们的沼泽中生长繁盛。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Mehmet.RedrockNews.Text | Live and drink, =name=. Any news from Red Rock? => 生而饮水，=name=。红岩有什么消息吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Mehmet.Welcome..Text | Live and drink, =name=. => 生而饮水，=name=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Mehmet.Welcome..Text2 | Taste what on the wind today, =name=? => 今天风里尝到什么了，=name=？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Mehmet.Welcome..Text3 | Moon and sun, =name=. => 月与日，=name=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Mehmet.Welcome..Text4 | I can taste lime, =name=. And mayhaps gallium? => 我能尝到石灰，=name=。也许还有镓？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Mehmet.Welcome..Text5 | Aye, the pest-vanquisher! Live and drink, =name=. => 是啊，害虫征服者！生而饮水，=name=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Mehmet.Welcome.MehmetIntroduce.Text | I am called =name=. => 我叫 =name=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Mehmet.Name | Mehmet, the tongue says. Live and drink, =name=. => 舌头说，是穆罕默德。生而饮水，=name=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Mehmet.BackFromRedrock.Text | Oh? Oh. {{emote|*Mehmet pauses.*}}\n\nDon't like the look o' that thing. Best bring it to Elder. Hut's northwise up the path. => 噢？噢。{{emote|*穆罕默德停顿。*}}\n\n我不喜欢那东西的样子。最好把它带给长老。小屋沿路往北。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation SimpleGeneric.Start.Text | =generic= => =generic=
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Tam.Welcome.Text | =player.apparentSpecies=? We are greeted! What do you desire? => =player.apparentSpecies=？我们相逢了！你想要什么？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Tam.Welcome.WhoIsTamChoice.Text | I am =name=. Who are you? => 我是 =name=。你是谁？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Tam.WhoIsTam.Text | It is a pleasure to know this, =player.apparentSpecies= =player.formalAddressTerm= =name=! I am Tam. => 很高兴知道这一点，=player.apparentSpecies= =player.formalAddressTerm= =name=！我是塔姆。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Tam.Joppa.Text | Joppa is my home, yes.\n\nI walked Moghra'yi in the caravans of my brethren and the saltback, but upon meeting Elder Irudad, knew at once to settle down here. You will understand, =player.formalAddressTerm= =player.apparentSpecies=, if you speak to him. => 约帕是我的家，是的。\n\n我曾随我的同胞与盐背的商队行走莫格拉伊，但一见到长老伊鲁达德，便立刻知道该在此定居。你若和他说话，就会明白的，=player.formalAddressTerm= =player.apparentSpecies=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Tam.AboutTheDromad.Text | I am dromad, =player.apparentSpecies= =player.formalAddressTerm=. Some say saltstrider. Do you know this? => 我是卓马德，=player.apparentSpecies= =player.formalAddressTerm=。有人说盐行者。你知道吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation DromadTrader.Start.Text | =player.apparentSpecies=? We are greeted! What do you desire? => =player.apparentSpecies=？我们相逢了！你想要什么？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation DromadTrader.AboutTheDromad.Text | I am dromad, =player.apparentSpecies= =player.formalAddressTerm=. Some say saltstrider. Do you know this? => 我是卓马德，=player.apparentSpecies= =player.formalAddressTerm=。有人说盐行者。你知道吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation WardenYrame.Start.Text.Text4 | {{emote|*Yrame grunts.*}} => {{emote|*伊拉姆哼了一声。*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation WardenYrame.Start.Text.Text5 | {{emote|*Yrame nods.*}} => {{emote|*伊拉姆点头。*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Nima Ruda.Start.Text.Text4 | The Fates watch you, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 命运注视着你，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation StarappleFarmer.Start.Text.Text2 | Mind the trees, =player.formalAddressTerm=. They ain't yours. => 注意那些树，=player.formalAddressTerm=。它们不是你的。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation StarappleFarmer.Start.Text.Text3 | Now you keep your eyes off my young, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 你可别盯着我的小崽看，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation StarappleFarmer.Start.Text.Text4 | Can't go wrong with starapples, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Good for what ails ya. => 星苹果不会错，=player.formalAddressTerm=。有啥毛病都管点用。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation PigFarmer.Start.Text.Text4 | Mind the pig leavins, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 小心猪留下的东西，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation PigFarmer.Start.Text.Text8 | It's get meat here or risk a slugsnout ball in the gut. Your choice, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 要么在这儿买肉，要么冒着肚子里挨一发蛞蝓嘴弹丸的风险。你选吧，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation PigFarmer.Start.Text.Text10 | Moon and sun, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 月与日，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation AmoebaFarmer.Start.Text.Text3 | Bless this mess and bless you, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 祝福这一团乱，也祝福你，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation SapientBear.Start.Text.Text5 | {{emote|*grunting*}} => {{emote|*哼哼*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation SapientBear.Start.Text.Text6 | {{emote|*snuffle*}} => {{emote|*嗅嗅*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation SapientBear.Start.Text.Text7 | {{emote|*whuffling*}} => {{emote|*呼哧嗅气*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation SapientBear.Start.Text.Text8 | {{emote|*heavy sigh*}} => {{emote|*重重叹气*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation SapientBear.Start.Text.Text9 | {{emote|*sigh*}} => {{emote|*叹气*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Cannibal.Start.Text.Text6 | {{emote|*licks lips*}} => {{emote|*舔舔嘴唇*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Arconaut.Start.Text.Text | {{emote|*nods mutely*}} => {{emote|*默默点头*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Arconaut.Start.Text.Text6 | {{emote|*ignores you*}} => {{emote|*无视你*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Arconaut.Start.Text.Text11 | {{emote|*shakes =pronouns.possessive= head*}} => {{emote|*摇摇=pronouns.possessive=头*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Arconaut.Start.Text.Text12 | {{emote|*puts a finger to =pronouns.possessive= lips*}} => {{emote|*把一根手指放到=pronouns.possessive=唇边*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Arconaut.Start.Text.Text14 | {{emote|*tenses as you approach*}} => {{emote|*在你靠近时绷紧身体*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Snapjaw.Start.Text.Text21 | {{emote|*drools silently, staring*}} => {{emote|*一边凝视，一边默默流口水*}}
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation Snapjaw.Start.Text.Text24 | rrrrrr... => rrrrrr……
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text3 | Come. Browse my wares, =player.formalAddressTerm=! => 来吧。看看我的货，=player.formalAddressTerm=！
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text4 | I see my wares catch your eye, =player.formalAddressTerm=. They can be yours. => 我看我的货入了你的眼，=player.formalAddressTerm=。它们可以归你。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text5 | Live and drink, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 生而饮水，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text6 | I have what you need, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 我有你需要的东西，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text7 | Ah, =player.formalAddressTerm=, thank the Eaters that you have found Qud's only honest shopkeep. => 啊，=player.formalAddressTerm=，感谢吞噬者，你找到了库德唯一诚实的店主。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text8 | On my honor, =player.formalAddressTerm=, my goods are of only the highest quality and I offer a fair trade. => 以我的荣誉起誓，=player.formalAddressTerm=，我的货只有最高品质，我也只做公平买卖。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text10 | Welcome, =player.formalAddressTerm=. How may I serve you today? => 欢迎，=player.formalAddressTerm=。今天我能为你效劳什么？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text11 | Do your waterskins grow heavy, =player.formalAddressTerm=? => 你的水囊是不是沉起来了，=player.formalAddressTerm=？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text12 | =player.FormalAddressTerm=, I beseech you. Enter. => =player.FormalAddressTerm=，我恳请你。请进。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation GenericMerchant.Start.Text.Text14 | May you find shade and vittle, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 愿你找到阴凉和口粮，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation MechanimistLibrarian.SlynthRequestAccept.Text | This wouldn't be the first time the Stiltgrounds have hosted refugees, =name=, and make no mistake: it is a burden upon the church, Catechists and Protectors in particular. But your words echo loud in our hearts as our hallways. Some in our number will see the slynth as the chosen of chosen, and if I speak to them first, everyone else will take it as Shekhinah's will. Which, arguably, it would be. Tell the slynth that the Mechanimists will have them. => 这不会是高跷地第一次接纳难民，=name=，而且别弄错：这对教会是个负担，尤其对教理师和护持者更是如此。但你的话在我们心中回响，正如在我们的廊道中回响一样响亮。我们之中有些人会把斯林斯视作被选者中的被选者；如果我先与他们谈，其他人都会把这视为谢金娜的旨意。可以说，那也确实会是。告诉斯林斯，机械信徒会接纳他们。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation MechanimistLibrarian.SlynthRequestReject.Text | I mean no slight to these slynth folk, =name=, but the Stiltgrounds have hosted refugees before and it is a substantial burden upon our stewards. Our resources and space are scant, and I must request that you find another home for them. May the Kasaphescence shine upon them, and you, in this endeavor. => 我无意轻慢这些斯林斯人，=name=，但高跷地过去接纳过难民，这对我们的司事是沉重负担。我们的资源和空间都很有限，我必须请求你为他们另寻家园。愿卡萨辉体在这份事业中照耀他们，也照耀你。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation MechanimistLibrarian.SlynthAbout.Text | =name=, bless you. Have you brought tidings of the slynth? => =name=，愿你受福。你带来了斯林斯的消息吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation MechanimistLibrarian.SlynthArrived.Text | Praise be to Shekhinah, =name=, your slynth friends are hard workers and quick learners!\n\nI can't help but feel a bit concerned at their ethic, and who in the church might take advantage of it. I hope to foster an interest in reading in them if I can, before they are taught incuriosity. Perhaps a book club? => 赞美谢金娜，=name=，你的斯林斯朋友们勤劳肯干，学得也快！\n\n他们这种品性让我忍不住有些担心，担心教会里会有人利用这一点。我希望能在他们被教会冷漠之前，尽力培养他们对阅读的兴趣。也许办个读书会？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation MechanimistLibrarian.SlynthSettled.Text | Live and learn, =name=.\n\nThe slynth are settling in as folk do. I see some flank the Priests and Catechists with empty eye, but some have proven hungry for knowledge. I have established a weekly Canticle study group, and its numbers grow each meeting.\n\nPraise be to Shekhinah for this meeting, =name=. => =name=，长生，求知。\n\n斯林斯正在像普通人那样安顿下来。我看到有些人目光空洞地侍立在祭司和教理师两侧，但也有些人展现出了对知识的渴求。我开办了每周一次的圣歌研习小组，每次聚会人数都在增加。\n\n为这次相遇赞美谢金娜，=name=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation bookbinder.Start.Text.Text | Don't breathe in too deep, =player.formalAddressTerm=, I've set some glue to dry. => 别吸得太深，=player.formalAddressTerm=，我放了些胶水等它干。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation bookbinder.Start.Text.Text3 | Greetings, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Feel free to examine my books closely. => 你好，=player.formalAddressTerm=。尽管仔细查看我的书。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation scribe.Start.Text.Text3 | Ink runs in my very veins, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 墨水就在我的血管里流淌，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation scribe.Start.Text.Text6 | Do be quick, =player.formalAddressTerm=, as I've much work to do. => 请快些，=player.formalAddressTerm=，我还有许多工作要做。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation schematics drafter.Start.Text.Text7 | I have lost much to my dedication. Help me gain anew, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 我为自己的奉献失去了许多。帮我重新得到些东西吧，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation schematics drafter.Start.Text.Text9 | Please, =player.formalAddressTerm=, buy a schematic. I'm sure it will be of use to you. => 拜托，=player.formalAddressTerm=，买张设计图吧。我相信它会对你有用。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation apothecary.Start.Text.Text3 | In the market for a tonic, =player.formalAddressTerm=? Spend water now or blood later, your choice. => 想买补剂吗，=player.formalAddressTerm=？现在花水，还是以后流血，你自己选。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation apothecary.Start.Text.2 | Get your hands on the Corpus Choliys for disease and fungus cures. => 去弄到 科普斯·乔利斯(Corpus Choliys)，用来治疗疾病和真菌。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation herbalist.Start.Text.Text7 | How are you feeling today, =player.formalAddressTerm=? => 今天感觉如何，=player.formalAddressTerm=？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation herbalist.Start.Text.Text8 | Moon and sun, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Keeping healthy? => 月与日，=player.formalAddressTerm=。身体安康吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation chef.Start.Text.Text | I tell you, =player.formalAddressTerm=, my recipes come from years of experience. There's none the like. => 我告诉你，=player.formalAddressTerm=，我的食谱来自多年经验。别处没有这样的。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation chef.Start.Text.Text3 | I will share my food-secrets with you, =player.formalAddressTerm=, if you're willing to make it worth my while. => 我愿意与你分享我的食物秘方，=player.formalAddressTerm=，只要你愿意让我觉得值得。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation chef.Start.Text.Text4 | Do you cook, =player.formalAddressTerm=? So long as you aren't the type to throw whatever local debris you find in the pot, I have wares for you. => 你做饭吗，=player.formalAddressTerm=？只要你不是那种把本地捡到的什么破烂都往锅里扔的人，我这里就有适合你的货。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation chef.Start.Text.Text8 | Live and eat, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => =player.formalAddressTerm=，长生，进食。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation chef.Start.Text.Text9 | Live and drink, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 生而饮水，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation kipper.Start.Text.Text5 | Welcome, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Need vittle? => 欢迎，=player.formalAddressTerm=。需要口粮吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation kipper.Start.Text.Text6 | Crave a bit of salt, =player.formalAddressTerm=, or a load of salt? => 想来点盐吗，=player.formalAddressTerm=，还是想来一大堆盐？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation kipper.Start.Text.Text8 | Are you a chef, =player.formalAddressTerm=? My vittles are of the highest quality. => 你是厨师吗，=player.formalAddressTerm=？我的口粮品质最高。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation kipper.Start.Text.Text9 | Nourishment for the road, =player.formalAddressTerm=? => 路上的补给，=player.formalAddressTerm=？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation vintner.Start.Text.Text | Greetings, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 你好，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation vintner.Start.Text.Text2 | Live and drink deeply, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => =player.formalAddressTerm=，生而畅饮。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation vintner.Start.Text.Text3 | Ah, =player.formalAddressTerm=, please come in. => 啊，=player.formalAddressTerm=，请进。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation vintner.Start.Text.Text4 | My wares are sweet and strong, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Care to try them? => 我的货又甜又烈，=player.formalAddressTerm=。想尝尝吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation vintner.Start.Text.Text5 | Tell me, =player.formalAddressTerm=, is there any sight more sad than a hookah tent without wine? => 告诉我，=player.formalAddressTerm=，还有什么景象比没有酒的水烟帐篷更悲伤？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation vintner.Start.Text.Text6 | Wine, cheese, bread. =player.FormalAddressTerm=, tell me, is there anything else you truly need? => 酒、奶酪、面包。=player.FormalAddressTerm=，告诉我，你真正需要的还有别的吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation vintner.Start.Text.Text8 | Greetings, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Try some rose wine? One rose is fair, but as you may know from hanging around the Stiltgrounds, five is death. => 你好，=player.formalAddressTerm=。要尝点玫瑰酒吗？一朵玫瑰尚好，但你在高跷地待久了也许知道，五朵便是死亡。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation ichormerchant.Start.Text.Text2 | Aren't they beautiful, =player.formalAddressTerm=? The bottles, the phials, the light shining through them. => 它们美得很，不是吗，=player.formalAddressTerm=？瓶子，小瓶，穿透它们的光。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation ichormerchant.Start.Text.Text6 | If it flows, I desire it. You should too, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 只要它会流动，我就渴望它。你也该如此，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation hatter.Start.Text.Text | Need something to complete your ensemble, =player.formalAddressTerm=? => 需要点什么来补完整身行头吗，=player.formalAddressTerm=？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation hatter.Start.Text.Text2 | With a good hat, =player.formalAddressTerm=, you'll last longer in the salt sun. => 有顶好帽子，=player.formalAddressTerm=，你就能在盐阳下撑得更久。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation hatter.Start.Text.Text3 | Peruse my wares, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Adorn your head or heads. => 细看我的货吧，=player.formalAddressTerm=。装点你的头，或者你的那些头。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation hatter.Start.Text.Text4 | Greetings, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Care for a new topper? => 你好，=player.formalAddressTerm=。想来顶新帽吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation hatter.Start.Text.Text5 | You need a new hat, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Or a helmet, if that's the life you lead. => 你需要一顶新帽子，=player.formalAddressTerm=。或者一顶头盔，如果你过的是那种日子。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation hatter.Start.Text.Text6 | If you're passing through baboon country, you'll want to protect your head, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 如果你要穿过狒狒地盘，就会想保护好自己的头，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation hatter.Start.Text.Text7 | Live and drink, =player.formalAddressTerm=. => 生而饮水，=player.formalAddressTerm=。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation shoemaker.Start.Text.Text | Hello, hello, =player.formalAddressTerm=, let's get your weary feet covered. => 你好，你好，=player.formalAddressTerm=，来给你疲惫的双脚找点遮护吧。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation shoemaker.Start.Text.Text2 | Come in, =player.formalAddressTerm=, and let me 'shoe' you around, ha ha! => 进来吧，=player.formalAddressTerm=，让我给你“鞋”着逛逛，哈哈！
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation shoemaker.Start.Text.Text3 | Boots! Shoes! Slippers! Sabatons! How would you prefer to cover your feet, =player.formalAddressTerm=? => 靴子！鞋！拖鞋！铁靴！你想怎样覆盖双脚，=player.formalAddressTerm=？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation shoemaker.Start.Text.Text4 | Even as high-quality as my products are, =player.formalAddressTerm=, I don't suggest you go walking in the fracti to test them out. => 我的产品再怎么高品质，=player.formalAddressTerm=，我也不建议你去分形林里走路测试它们。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation shoemaker.Start.Text.Text5 | Anything you need to ask 'a boot', =player.FormalAddressTerm=? Just a little cobbler's joke, there. => 有什么关于“靴”要问的吗，=player.FormalAddressTerm=？只是个鞋匠小笑话。
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation shoemaker.Start.Text.Text6 | Hot sands out there, =player.formalAddressTerm=. Is your footwear protecting you? => 外头沙子很烫，=player.formalAddressTerm=。你的鞋履能保护你吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation shoemaker.Start.Text.Text7 | Hello, =player.formalAddressTerm=! Care to be shod? => 你好，=player.formalAddressTerm=！想穿上鞋吗？
[QudCnSupplement] STRING_REVIEW: Conversation shoemaker.Start.Text.Text8 | Walk a few parasangs in my shoes, =player.formalAddressTerm=, and you'll wonder how you ever did otherwise. => 穿着我的鞋走上几帕拉桑，=player.formalAddressTerm=，你会奇怪自己以前怎么能不这样走。
[CN-QA] runtime strings=10211/10211; mismatches=0
